WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.720
On a visit, things rarely happen in the order of a form.

2
00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:07.320
With Quickler, you can answer in the order that suits you best,

3
00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:10.960
whether that's a text message, a voice note, a photo, a document or

4
00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:12.370
even your location,

5
00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:15.160
Quickler will put each one of these in the right place.
